      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-right \" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 91px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/f/fe/Mail.png/revision/latest?cb=20150721185503\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Mail\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/f/fe/Mail.png/revision/latest?cb=20150721185503\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"91\" height=\"87\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Mail.png\" data-image-key=\"Mail.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p><b>Mail</b> is a new feature added in <a href=\"/wiki/Version_history#2.2.3\" title=\"Version history\">version 2.2.3</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i>. The mailbox will most likely be used as a means for <a href=\"/wiki/Sinsiroad\" title=\"Sinsiroad\">Sinsiroad</a> to create announcements. The mailbox can be accessed through the main menu of the game. Mail may have a gift attached to it, which players can then receive. After receiving it, the gift's button will disappear and \"(Already it has received a gift)\" will appear instead.\n</p>\nNone\n<table style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Sender\n</th>\n<th>Date sent\n</th>\n<th>Title\n</th>\n<th>Message\n</th>\n<th>Gift attached\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sinsiroad\" title=\"Sinsiroad\">Sinsiroad</a>\n</td>\n<td>2015.09.30\n</td>\n<td>Compensation for notice error\n</td>\n<td>We have notified 'likeability max increment' with October 1 event. But it has been problem.<br />We give 10 Rubies as compensation.<br /> Sorry for the confusion.<br />Likeability patch will come when the next event. Please wait.\n</td>\n<td>10 <span class=\"mw-default-size mw-valign-top\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span title=\"Ruby\"><img alt=\"Ruby\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/a/aa/Gem.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/14?cb=20150721185508\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gem.png\" data-image-key=\"Gem.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sinsiroad\n</td>\n<td>2015.10.16\n</td>\n<td>New Event\n</td>\n<td>Please update game from Google Play when can't download event. Thank you.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<table id=\"Stub\" class=\"noprint stub plainlinks\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><i>This article is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Stub\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:Stub\">stub</a>. You can help Potion Maker Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://potionmaker.fandom.com/wiki/Mail?action=edit&amp;useeditor=source\">expanding it</a>.</i>\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261013065846\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 13/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 448/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.670      1 -total\n 60.21%    4.618      1 Template:Ruby\n 20.87%    1.601      1 Template:Stub\n 17.35%    1.331      1 Template:PM\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_potionmaker783:pcache:idhash:2699-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261013065846 and revision id 5493. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
